        "defaultRecommendation": "bounded-child",
        "childShape": "docs-fixtures-media-pool-copy"
      },
      {
        "id": "mpeg-ts-mov",
        "rank": 2,
        "rubric": "pro-interchange",
        "title": "MOV / MPEG-TS wrapping codecs Myrelith already names",
        "demand": "Camera and broadcast files often arrive as MOV or MPEG-TS around AVC/AAC. Advertised support is MP4/WebM. MPEG-TS silently omits unrecognized stream types instead of reporting them.",
